 graph summary indicates a low repeat ratio, suggesting that interactions are not frequent enough to form a closure wave.\n- **Steps 18-32**: Various computations show low event density and high partner-to-event ratios, further supporting the lack of significant activity.\n\nGiven the limited evidence and the low activity levels, we cannot confidently assert the presence of a closure wave.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"t_0e3f1856\",\n  \"decision\": \"insufficient\",\n  \"mechanism\": \"closure_wave\",\n  \"entities\": [15, 34, 38, 54, 99, 118, 127, 144, 220, 222, 233, 237],\n  \"window\": [39646, 51646],\n  \"confidence\": 0.2,\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"trace_id\": \"step_01\",\n      \"role\": \"support\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"trace_id\": \"step_14\",\n      \"role\": \"confounder_control\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"trace_id\": \"step_15\",\n      \"role\": \"confounder_control\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"trace_id\": \"step_17\",\n      \"role\": \"confounder_control\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"narrative\": \"There is insufficient evidence to support the presence of a genuine temporal closure wave in the specified interval. The low number of events and limited interaction among the nodes suggest that the conditions for a closure wave are not met.\"\n}\n```", "total_input_tokens": 14127, "total_output_tokens": 4656, "total_tokens": 18783, "total_latency_ms": 81466, "llm_calls": 2, "schema_repairs": 0, "tool_protocol_errors": 0, "status": "success", "error": ""}